</body>
</html>
```

### `styles.css`

```css
/* GLOBAL RESET AND BACKGROUND STYLES */
body, html {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    height: 100%; /* Ensures the body takes up the full viewport height */
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden; /* CRITICAL: Prevents any scrolling */
    background-color: black; /* Fallback background color */
    font-family: sans-serif; /* A clean, default font */
    color: white;
}

/* VIDEO STYLING */
#background-video {
    position: fixed; /* Keeps the video fixed in the background */
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    min-width: 100%; /* Ensures it covers the entire width */
    min-height: 100%; /* Ensures it covers the entire height */
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    z-index: -100; /* Pushes the video behind all other content */
    object-fit: cover; /* Ensures the video covers the area without stretching unnaturally */
}

/* CONTENT CONTAINER STYLING (Centering) */
.content-container {
    position: absolute; /* Allows us to center content relative to the viewport */
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex; /* Enables flexbox */
    justify-content: center; /* Centers content horizontally */
    align-items: center; /* Centers content vertically */
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 1; /* Ensures the text and button are above the video */
}

/* HERO TEXT STYLING */
.main-title {
    font-size: 5vw; /* Responsive font size based on viewport width */
    font-weight: 900; /* Extra bold */
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

/* BUTTON STYLING - INITIAL STATE (Faded, Transparent) */
.waitlist-button {
    padding: 15px 35px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid white; /* White outline */
    background-color: transparent; /* Transparent background */
    color: white; /* White text */
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out; /* Smooth transition for hover effects */
    outline: none; /* Removes default focus outline */
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* BUTTON STYLING - HOVER STATE (Full White, Black Text) */
.waitlist-button:hover {
    background-color: white; /* Full white background */
    color: black; /* Black text */
    /* Optional: You can add box-shadow here for a more 'popping' effect */
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
}
```

### How to Run This Locally

1.  **Create a Folder:** Make a new folder for your project (e.g., `zeroh-website`).
2.  **Save Files:**
    *   Save the HTML code above as `index.html` inside the folder.
    *   Save the CSS code above as `styles.css` inside the folder.
3.  **Add Video:** **Crucially**, find a video file (e.g., `bg.mp4`) and place it in the same folder. Then, update this line in `index.html`:
